'{\"is_correct\": true, \"explanation\": \"Khớp chính xác với nội dung câu 13 trong bài luyện nghe Part 4.\", \"display_text\": \"welcome to impact unlocked the podcast for businesses wanting to streamline their operations with new technology in today\'s episode i\'ll talk about how to raise money by leveraging social media applications to get donations i could focus on specific applications but these things are constantly changing instead i\'ll speak generally about how these types of applications can help you connect with potential donors\"}', '2026-09-15 07:19:45'),
